		text = "District 11 belongs to K Corp, whose Singularity is the HP Ampule: one dose and a body puts itself back the way it remembers being, whole and uninjured. It needs the brain intact, it isn't cheap, and it is the most trusted medicine in the City.\n\nK Corp's Nest is the cleanest anywhere: strict checkpoints, drones overhead, and a memory-wipe procedure for anyone who sees too much. Its staff hold Classes that count upward, from Class 1 rescue duty in the streets to the Class 3 Excision Staff who guard the labs, and who wait in glass tubes when they're off duty.",
